<title>USA: Chicago Miniature Lamp picks Sills as CFO.</title>
<headline>Chicago Miniature Lamp picks Sills as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>CANTON, Mass. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Miniature Lamp Inc said Thursday that it had named John Sills to replace Ron Goldstein as chief financial officer and executive vice-president.</p>
<p>The company said that Goldstein resigned to pursue other interests, but wil remain to assist in the transition for an unspecified period of time.</p>
<p>Sills, it said, comes from previous positions at Price Waterhouse and the Robertson-Ceco Corp, among others.</p>
